  "body": "Set in a peaceful, family-friendly cul-de-sac, this well-positioned property presents an excellent opportunity for homebuyers, investors and those looking for a generous freehold landholding.\r\n\r\nOffered to the market for the first time in 11 years and with vacant possession, this property provides flexibility for your move and settlement plans.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n• 770m² (approx.) freehold land – a generous site with future potential\r\n• 3 double bedrooms and 2 bathrooms\r\n• Open-plan kitchen, dining and living – offering a practical layout for everyday family living and entertaining\r\n• Separate laundry for added practicality\r\n• Deck – ideal for relaxing and enjoying the outdoors\r\n• Prime location – within easy walking distance of the beach, park playground and pump track\r\n• Convenient motorway access for an easy commute\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a comfortable home in a peaceful coastal setting or an investment with a substantial freehold landholding, this property is well worth your inspection.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing or come along to the next open home.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
